1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,600
(Howard:)Hey, Ma.

2
00:00:01,775 --> 00:00:05,575
(Howard:)You know, we could see each other
if you turn on the computer.

3
00:00:05,746 --> 00:00:07,836
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)I'm not going near that fakakta thing.

4
00:00:08,048 --> 00:00:10,538
I'll catch a computer virus!

5
00:00:11,919 --> 00:00:14,949
(Howard:)You can't catch a computer virus.

6
00:00:15,122 --> 00:00:19,252
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Oh, so now you're an astronaut
and a doctor?

7
00:00:20,427 --> 00:00:22,057
(Howard:)What do you want, Ma?

8
00:00:23,297 --> 00:00:27,067
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Your wife says you have
something important to tell me.

9
00:00:27,768 --> 00:00:30,638
Okay, here it is:

10
00:00:31,105 --> 00:00:35,165
(Howard:)Bernadette and I
are starting a life together.

11
00:00:35,342 --> 00:00:36,432
(Sheldon:)- And...
- Oh, God.

12
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:38,270
You are gonna leave me!

13
00:00:38,445 --> 00:00:40,475
(Sheldon:)- Ma...
- It's okay.

14
00:00:40,781 --> 00:00:42,941
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Your father left me, you left me.

15
00:00:43,117 --> 00:00:47,017
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)I guess I'm just the kind of person
people like to leave.

16
00:00:49,289 --> 00:00:53,229
(Howard:)It's not definite. I'll talk to Bernadette.

